# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`.

## Layout

- Intro hero: flat greige on phones; from 801px white→greige gradient (same as homepage hero); CTA → kontakt (“Napsat o rituálu”)
- Continuous **feed of whole wedding posts** (same body as detail via `Posts/body.twig` + `Posts/parts.twig`)
- Full-bleed greige shells (`.ritualy-feed__item`) with a centered `.post-article` inside; `.75rem` white gaps between bands
- Title links to the standalone post URL (`linkedTitle`); no section eyebrow in the feed
- Infinite scroll: first **4** posts, then `?page=N&partial=1` HTML fragments (`X-Feed-Next` header); JS in `static/javascript/index.js`
- Post detail: current post first, then older posts via `?partial=1&after={id}` (same feed chrome as the index)
- No scroll / entrance animations on the index
